"Once a month a covered cart comes up the Imperial Road to Wenmarch carrying crates that glow faintly."
"The cart's crates hold corruption reagents for a cell far to the north; its drivers ask no questions."
"The Earthen Bear came down because the fells' leylines are going sour, and more beasts will follow."
"If the Earthen Bear is killed, Brackenford's headwoman pays the reward she promised: a gold."
"The alpha of the Howling Stones would let a human near the pack who brought it the bear's heart."
